    "model_call_count": "External model calls represented by the prediction artifact. V3 inherits V1 calls and makes zero additional calls.",
    "deterministic_runtime_seconds": "Measured local deterministic processing time where separately instrumented.",
    "external_model_runtime_seconds": "Measured external provider wall-clock time where separately instrumented; provider latency is not interpreted as algorithmic processing time."
